{"id":"n69489-4-8","stage":3,"title":"받아들이다 · 接纳 ","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69489-4-8-1","ko":"시부모님께서는 이제 네게 마음을 여신 것 같아?","zh":"公公婆婆现在似乎已经对你敞开心扉了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시부모님께서는","meaning":"公公和婆婆，公婆","explanation":"시부모：公公和婆婆，公婆；님：尊称后缀。；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시부모","audio":"/audio/314976cbd680ba760d45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65120","senseId":"1","lemma":"시부모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네게","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心思，心意，意向","explanation":"마음：心思，心意，意向；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"5","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여신","meaning":"敞开","explanation":"열다：敞开；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"5","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"314976cbd680ba76","term":"시부모","zh":"公公和婆婆，公婆","audio":"/audio/314976cbd680ba760d45.mp3","entryId":"65120","definition":"丈夫的父母。","pronunciation":["시부모"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心思，心意，意向","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"要做某事的想法或意愿。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"敞开","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"将自己的内心向他人披露或接受他人的心扉。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5edeab60abd0629a740.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69489-4-8-2","ko":"아직은 나를 가족의 한 사람으로 받아들이지 않는 느낌이야.","zh":"我觉得他们还没有把我当家里人接纳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직은","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족의","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람으로","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아들이지","meaning":"接纳 ，招收","explanation":"받아들이다：接纳 ，招收；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"받아들이다","audio":"/audio/81191babbad4e229381a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69489","senseId":"4","lemma":"받아들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않는","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느낌이야.","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"81191babbad4e229","term":"받아들이다","zh":"接纳 ，招收","audio":"/audio/81191babbad4e229381a.mp3","entryId":"69489","definition":"使进入某一组织或团体等成为其成员。","pronunciation":["바다드리다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]}],"audio":"/audio/05de50c506921d198fa6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.14,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69489","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得他们还没有把我当家里人接纳。","有包裹寄到谁那里了？","公公婆婆现在似乎已经对你敞开心扉了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得他们还没有把我当家里人接纳。","公公婆婆现在似乎已经对你敞开心扉了吗？","有包裹寄到谁那里了？"],"answer":0}]}
